{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Frequently Asked Questions"}], "prev": {"link": "../sqlite3-operationalerror-database-is-locked/", "title": "sqlite3.OperationalError: database is locked"}, "next": {"link": "../socket-send-oserror-timeouterror-connection-lost-reset/", "title": "socket.send(), OSError(), TimeoutError(), Connection lost/reset"}, "title": "sqlite3.InterfaceError: Error binding parameter", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"sqlite3-interfaceerror-error-binding-parameter\">\n<h1>sqlite3.InterfaceError: Error binding parameter<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#sqlite3-interfaceerror-error-binding-parameter\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>This error occurs when you pass a chat id value of the wrong type when trying to call a method. Most likely, you\naccidentally passed the whole user or chat object instead of the id or username.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-python notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"c1\"># Wrong. You passed the whole Chat instance</span>\n<span class=\"n\">app</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">send_message</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">chat</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;text&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># Correct</span>\n<span class=\"n\">app</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">send_message</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">chat_id</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">chat</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;text&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["faq/socket-send-oserror-timeouterror-connection-lost-reset", "socket.send(), OSError(), TimeoutError(), Connection lost/reset", "N", "next"], ["faq/sqlite3-operationalerror-database-is-locked", "sqlite3.OperationalError: database is locked", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">sqlite3.InterfaceError: Error binding parameter</a></li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": false, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "faq/sqlite3-interfaceerror-error-binding-parameter", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": true, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}